             10 BS-CCY-CUTOFF-TIME       PIC 9(4).
             10 BS-CCY-SETTLE-TIER       PIC 9(1).
             10 BS-CCY-MIN-LOT           PIC S9(18)V9(8) COMP-3.
             10 BS-CCY-RATE-TO-USD       PIC S9(9)V9(8)  COMP-3.

